{
  "format": 1,
  "id": "id/bipa4.u10",
  "language": "id",
  "unit": "bipa4.u10",
  "version": 1,
  "content_hash": "bae31f1f513dd77bea8963749772e113b756dbedb4f32c3e54ec41cca580b313",
  "lessons": [
    {
      "id": "bipa4.u10.l01",
      "sha256": "549e9f3b3ec51e85529a27e9f8ea4896a3872fef931a7dcfa4de9be82e04e162"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa4.u10.l02",
      "sha256": "32a1c43b1f38615fe4ca4fe22134cb1b289a2831837ece06de67f65d9a2e937b"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa4.u10.l03",
      "sha256": "a9bd96a404b91a77ece9eb718915890f21eda08a99df0436d18115a66e86bf8f"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa4.u10.l04",
      "sha256": "a99c250e9673ea3223e47aec86f6b7042a5997c836ea3f80d0728a81d7dc6445"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa4.u10.l05",
      "sha256": "bed04bda62a0b3e6a21bd05f93c5352c160beb5ae4b9de8342201b99f09ce60c"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa4.u10.l06",
      "sha256": "6525b4aeb25fa503e94f432438d0e0e59f4175e0bde39e98f5a311e76cb47110"
    }
  ],
  "audio": [
    {
      "key": "0032422e985e39f55de6b576d7a9a107d56fb015f6bfa355d6eef79b3f69afa8",
      "text": "gelar",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "03f6068e093e9ea1f3f94c16f654d6a35c0d005d7b4e9975ee05fe332a3fc3fa",
      "text": "Beliau menjabat sebagai gubernur pertama Sulawesi. Semboyannya, Si tou timou tumou tou, artinya manusia hidup untuk memanusiakan manusia.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 137,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "040613f5811084eb593ab71c169a98e45b58cc3d514f62de3b98d56626b487ea",
      "text": "Kisah tokoh itu menjadi buah bibir di seluruh negeri.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 53,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "07e12f2fca4ba2a2a7dd84708de4b5489026291df45fd0ec8734d7b5c11d6391",
      "text": "Bapak tua tadi juga ramah dan rendah hati.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 42,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a81660e3d629bb2b3c0ef934f03db7eb4599534d63ade45253e23d80a0423f7",
      "text": "Ya. Beliau wafat di Jakarta, tetapi dimakamkan di sini, di kota kelahirannya.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 77,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "120570eb246b4c7c41ea8bc70925a0790e16f64d92060655eae951812573a695",
      "text": "Beliau wafat pada tahun 1949 dan dimakamkan di Tondano.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 55,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "13430d83322c6139bcf41ac908d9b168411b05fcd61c7a1911474d04d3ec861e",
      "text": "Yang terhormat Bapak Wali Kota dan hadirin yang berbahagia.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 59,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "19333d573516f5b576bb301ad78d5ac7594b8c873039e621c76156c932c3ae95",
      "text": "Saya membawa buah tangan dari Tomohon untuk keluarga.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 53,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "1acbb6c3da6d3d7be9267b0da8b20c51c9582a97c08d1aa939e1d7e914516f7a",
      "text": "Riwayat hidup beliau luar biasa. Beliau belajar di Eropa dan menjabat sebagai gubernur.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 87,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "1c1938de4d08ee6f4c5bc8f2b1063f2c96266cd8d605640a433f3017a6d73577",
      "text": "menyalahkan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 11,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2819373d9060e6bd40af5e99cc72aa7e09083d42e2608fb240dc16372a472a32",
      "text": "Asal jangan jadi kambing hitam kalau bunganya layu, ya!",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 55,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "291a6e4a123954bc556e21f59720ade80c389be1a4076d32596046cd98db5aea",
      "text": "Mas, ini makam Sam Ratulangi, ya?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 33,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "29659384ebeeb4fcca51d9dedbf69981e8141439a09f24edad3997eb51bacd9a",
      "text": "Apa yang beliau lakukan?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 24,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2a4a2d22d0b9677e3e20f43b00f3f83c5afe0528ed3cd1bb7fedbba3b09a7da1",
      "text": "Semoga persahabatan Indonesia dan Mesir semakin kuat.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 53,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3564cabb5fed27e75747752947cb6d326e4858b84ad92d5c0e947aa10aedb9b9",
      "text": "mewakili",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "36af08280d5e6aa6e3743e4fcc8c39981d7397be42a02fc349718b8a0f6acec6",
      "text": "Hadirin yang terhormat, hari ini saya akan menceritakan riwayat hidup Sam Ratulangi.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 84,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3824c6c3bf437c60ea7102697f347959b6a461e762b341441c3859e76b0ac17a",
      "text": "sambutan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3ad66ccdb65a2b05c14187713775064c789d46589d31cb325a9ae6d3c1707888",
      "text": "Pemimpin yang baik tidak menyalahkan orang lain.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 48,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3b3b1a564013191eb4d04fe9ebf4ba5baec66ada91f729d23ed3f79105825b96",
      "text": "Kamu beli apa di pasar tadi?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 28,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "40b94a133ccac66a3363a074ddf4db5af3e4a37d112c111356934f55f3372d47",
      "text": "Beliau adalah tokoh yang rendah hati dan dekat dengan rakyat.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 61,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "41b810f990ee6b02cf2921b3b83ce861a10c2448898e5a05d9cbb6bdb6099902",
      "text": "buah bibir",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 10,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "4351ae2ff7f08435303ac9099b0f4cef98da7d952f84fc93b55280fddebfe303",
      "text": "Tokoh itu keras kepala, tetapi dia membanting tulang untuk rakyatnya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 69,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "44390d9a47fc3b22d4226400521978e0ee9341c4e30a882bbf68eff3340a715d",
      "text": "buah tangan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 11,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "45e0a7fe7896cffaf481822b9997c371f396f5db10c0ac3b15e032eb1f1f0df5",
      "text": "Yang terhormat panitia festival, hadirin yang berbahagia, saya bangga mewakili Mesir di Tomohon.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 96,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "4690ff67b104c04efb8f3af5719ca6e7d9474a8da38dfcaf6eb79badbfbd65af",
      "text": "persahabatan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 12,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "47ed4ce2f432d1010d770721dd739b940fac239f72e08adfea9edcb980cf4714",
      "text": "Petani bunga di Kakaskasen membanting tulang dari pagi sampai malam.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 68,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "498d53c53e7c57218b080ab54832a7828c5f77015396ba040b94ddd9572f7114",
      "text": "kesempatan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 10,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "4b5843bcd634e9f73a83fc60d09aba2ee3632bffb9bf80451b782311a2e2423a",
      "text": "wafat",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "4bd44ed8f12d5a4cbf6cbb1f71d4db67fee9cba77fe7fdfb739e19e18ef7b0fe",
      "text": "Wah! Bagaimana cara membukanya?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 31,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "4bd6b4d00c2fc4e6c97f90db18edf77a2b71f1a10b001474d49e1f10ee633e32",
      "text": "akhir kata",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 10,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "536b5500225e6842bbde5ba84224b81a20631e421da563c45f8816fe8f436259",
      "text": "Hadirin yang terhormat, puji syukur kepada Tuhan atas festival yang indah ini.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 78,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "53e1b36d7219077a7d8e6ba1df3f953e2554fe628ef6372847d1fe948384db19",
      "text": "Beliau menjabat sebagai Gubernur Sulawesi yang pertama.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 55,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "54165862246c5b19d448069c602f3053a09bf7ddac97cc41a5a44f0cfea8f7be",
      "text": "Wah, nanti kamu jadi buah bibir di kantor!",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 42,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "560b19243679e93b7d58a1839ff15624fa877581fed514ca5d977bf45ceff968",
      "text": "Asal saya tidak jadi tinggi hati, ya!",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 37,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "573d9269887c05b7a7b1d78522d7fee46920f6f9de7217c184e0893e33613a56",
      "text": "makan garam",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 11,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5b8992b99377fa5c24e8478e874b4bf1c9b70aaf110962071b2c31f65aa16d8c",
      "text": "Ya, beliau sudah banyak makan garam. Sudah empat puluh tahun menanam bunga.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 75,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5d6add0aa0fb86d84cb7ccf6e0dea8f01a2034d9c3b77c0f9ede38bd504886e4",
      "text": "Jangan jadikan dia kambing hitam atas kesalahan tim.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 52,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "612cf81504557e72110698bac17086e3559ab6bb299df14f31e5653d014a1e13",
      "text": "Beliau menjabat sebagai gubernur dan dimakamkan di Tondano.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 59,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "647ec1e1245be7089ca373db528af07c6bb21f2609cb5f678419ae4db02fbc81",
      "text": "Terima kasih, Bu. Sebenarnya saya agak gugup.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 45,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "6700b264941c59d85e3846436e3d8c2f2159558f819eebd36196baf842aaa34d",
      "text": "Sam Ratulangi lahir di Tondano pada tahun 1890.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 47,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "68f2768a6d05a522f68833c44d6e726322841ca872f22eef708720b9a0b57591",
      "text": "gubernur",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "6a740abc3bb1a07db3cf83367afb129f5af45658f066833660cbe1eb752641b6",
      "text": "Dan beliau tetap rendah hati. Namanya menjadi buah bibir sampai sekarang.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 73,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "74f900a7367015f402ce51938d5d20f48864471784242585ba7061c356ddc46f",
      "text": "Sam Ratulangi lahir di Tondano dan wafat pada tahun 1949.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 57,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "75f2daab94dc60cc2b00d014737ee540aa6545694d025c882f9f0a5e6ba7eb2c",
      "text": "Saya berdiri di sini mewakili teman-teman dari Mesir.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 53,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "76789d6eefa6b73927b46c114f16ea8dcc645d67853b57999d264522f6640d8b",
      "text": "Semoga persahabatan kita semakin kuat.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 38,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "85be9ca4f90c6a965e528a82ccaf7a9e7044700cb6c91cc01728c08540ab2db6",
      "text": "menjabat",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "870d73d9ebb2d59c01a2a7844cebfda139e0f2c0c3fc1477cb8b5cff98308cf1",
      "text": "rendah hati",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 11,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "884a66df5048d685667dcd9b29a4997b88957ee6de18ca411d5108a99f5f5046",
      "text": "dimakamkan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 10,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "89eda7a80318cffa1cff8b7c3578e515f63c048098ed3c5016356457cf70c156",
      "text": "puji syukur",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 11,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "8b266e14b07284ec5d456e377e66f60d3f85a8ae5d489423c9568d35e6018a14",
      "text": "Pidatomu bagus sekali, Pak Mohamed!",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 35,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "8d9a7d9b6ba3ec1701b4d2f623937b1b809a8b8a43bc20fe8feb1e683e7411e5",
      "text": "Beliau rendah hati dan membanting tulang untuk rakyat.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 54,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "8ddd816f495059d3afc8163b9b0bff11b2110bb8b0f88ea3628d3157df6da2bd",
      "text": "Panitia festival meminta kamu memberikan sambutan singkat.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 58,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "8efc6aa8eca77ccf5c20aead37922c052c9a3ff5fc80b0bd7558e2fd4cb2dece",
      "text": "Dalam riwayat hidupnya, beliau menjabat sebagai gubernur dan mendapat gelar Pahlawan Nasional.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 94,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "92fbaa33a63953ed60f8fccecb2580e1c3f9f4544b618d563c536d81888212c8",
      "text": "Mas, siapa Sam Ratulangi? Namanya ada di bandara Manado.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 56,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "93c17ab9e4863828ead4de80ba7c4c4b4de90d06e9559f891164b47ddd7a16c1",
      "text": "tinggi hati",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 11,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "9431093ea9d8e5f8e1f3b0ddc6f6205a779409572ef1fbca7351bdbd7f27afed",
      "text": "Tidak kelihatan! Bagian tentang persahabatan Indonesia dan Mesir sangat indah.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 78,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "9546bff05bf645825279d481b3311646d2cd5aeeb85bba87d460660b9035baf3",
      "text": "Saya akan menulis riwayat hidup beliau untuk blog saya.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 55,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "998b3d1b3780a3b7e782b68062dd4f0e4c22215cda72f68a1b2f58f9dd4667c5",
      "text": "Puji syukur kepada Tuhan Yang Maha Esa.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 39,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "9db2ec20c70573bd32251d1017cbff8172ccc0edcab18607cef1d6ac4ee4facf",
      "text": "Lalu saya tutup dengan akhir kata dan terima kasih, ya?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 55,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a1c77c6c5cb651f9cf7612429929acfebd0e1916df74f77156829aeadbaf4758",
      "text": "Wah, besok kamu jadi buah bibir di Tomohon!",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 43,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a5d59f489e29c9c6d3b3b236dbd416c53fd89fa2c6e3032dbb2b6328c5f945c2",
      "text": "Kakek saya rendah hati dan sudah banyak makan garam.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 52,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a7c6116da5a6b3dc70b4c08334287e623a8646cd034bb16b30be6d21942c76d9",
      "text": "Terima kasih atas kesempatan yang diberikan kepada saya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 56,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a87b20d1546530486e4abbb106c9e7e441a5ba8857300e1b38262408dd1ce6f2",
      "text": "Anak itu memang keras kepala.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 29,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ab8f0151b2ed3317d64af55f37185dd49c3ccd0f080409873815981fe755caa6",
      "text": "Akhir kata, terima kasih atas perhatian Anda.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 45,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "b3356f3fbdcfc77702fa50580faffe0d3bcdfc1943e7228a071281f602e442d7",
      "text": "banting tulang",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 14,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "b37b58b3bb6a567210333ce5e4cfb31d4fcec6c14afca389184949cecf50ebf3",
      "text": "Pada tahun 1919, beliau mendapat gelar doktor di Swiss.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 55,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "b72e934a8e012a3f84d98046b86772e0576ca711a99d0c534c126de9d9bef42f",
      "text": "Buah tangan untuk teman-teman di Jakarta.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 41,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ba1ca1ca7a76793552433a07049a18d1abf86ab86975140cfd5394b58d8d42b5",
      "text": "riwayat hidup",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 13,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "bdc26622f587afbc2da018305b18147b54c49ce8d4e35a4c0c40894b35b4c347",
      "text": "Para petani bunga membanting tulang setiap hari.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
